nerability/CVE-2026-102556"},"summary":"A flaw was found in libsoup. When handling an incoming WebSocket Pong frame, SoupWebsocketConnection emitted the ::pong signal with a GByteArray pointer even though the signal is declared to pass a GBytes. Applications connecting a handler that follows the documented GBytes API can trigger heap corruption or a crash upon receiving a crafted Pong.","threat_meta":null,"title":"Libsoup: libsoup: heap buffer overflow from websocket pong signal type confusion","topics":["advisory","cwe-843"],"type":"advisory","updated_at":"2026-10-31T18:11:59.530849Z","vendors":[]},{"abstract_source":null,"affected_versions":[],"affiliations":[],"authors":[],"cves":["CVE-2026-11861"],"date_precision":"exact","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T05:51:27.798042Z","first_seen_at":"2026-11-02T05:51:27.798042Z","id":"osv:CVE-2026-11861","is_backfill":false,"lang":"en","products":[],"published_at":"2026-08-20T10:39:08.025000Z","published_year":null,"raw_text":null,"references":["https://access.redhat.com/downloads/content/package-browser/","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:70564","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:72279","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:82935","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:83083","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:83084","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:83085","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:83460","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:83461","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:89836","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:93071","https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2026-11861","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/tree/main/cves/2026/11xxx/CVE-2026-11861.json","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-11861","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2487472"],"risk":{"cvss_score":null,"cvss_vector":"CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:C/C:H/I:H/A:N","due_date":null,"epss_percentile":null,"epss_score":null,"exploit_in_the_wild":null,"exploit_matu